# ============================================================================
# Team_Intelligence_Hub — root .gitignore
# Covers both TeamIntelligenceHub.Backend (.NET) and AppSource 7-23 (Vite/React).
# Patterns with no leading slash match at any depth, so one file here is enough
# even though each subproject also carries its own local .gitignore.
# ============================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — never commit these, regardless of which folder they're in.
# This project's own CLAUDE.md flags TeamIntelligenceHub.API/appsettings.json
# (the base file, not just its Development/Local variants) as holding real
# connection strings and API keys, since dotnet user-secrets isn't in use for
# every value here — so the base file is included, not just the usual
# appsettings.*.json pattern.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
appsettings.json
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.*.example.json
secrets.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .NET (TeamIntelligenceHub.Backend)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
artifacts/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
TestResults/
.vs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Node / Vite (AppSource 7-23)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
*.log
logs/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors / IDEs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.sw?

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS junk
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
